<title>Ethiopia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ethiopia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ethiopia-2026-11-01T09:33:00.941Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 09:33:00 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The prime minister has placed senior ministers in military training at a centre in Hurso while Ethiopian army drones have struck displaced-person camps in Amhara, killing civilians including children, and a separate drone strike in Tigray killed civilians collecting grain. Sudan accuses Ethiopia of using Assosa Airport as a launch base for RSF drones and of supplying arms to the RSF. Two attacks four days apart in Oromia killed 60 Orthodox Christians. The conflict continues amid the Fano insurgency in Amhara that began in 2023 over security reforms. 2,824 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFA1LVJRU1FVNjJwb1g1TFM3bzYwOFlEVkYyWFF5UGx4aDlXQ1pZSHI2VWpucmFuT2tTeWg3MUdvajR1aGxUN1FrSUlJMC1sUlVUR1RoUXFFdGdEaWNDX1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxQY0RwX2VmWlJ6VjZhaGxkR2pVVWpOdEhqUl93TG56bFVPQ25lcHZQUXZtV1lvVGliQW9DbVhIWjA4ODFua0FQODRLUVVtdmdxZVg4MU9VeXRCMmVGZTI5V0pWSWljOXNzcmlQdUdqMGlJQkRXRFhDMDUxbXNwZkY2WHF6TQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOR2RXbGFHYTlkMXR4Wmo1NTBNQ0lIWXZIMFlBcVB5bGhNS2pjM2hwN0RhdzRsbGR2YWdWX1ZCbEhVMnB2QkFNZ0MxdGRQRUFaWDdTV0hCWUdIV2NwSGhGTE8tV29nU28zcmJzMmNJMjFQdWJsQUZzb3BKb0J1dFlDSDVZRHhDYVhyZkdDeHRGTGpxeXlfSHU3bkIyTEg5YS1SOU10T0JMdnRfUmdMdW4zaDhWQXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPMGVLMllaRjMxQUdDaDJvQUk4WXFVdWI0VXNfc2ZZaUx6YkFteVdPY1BobFp6MjItRU1vNGQ4TXVBeWdKa1lHUEpUUzNocEJJN01BSDVPMURjVXA0RGktUUcwdzRHeUVNa3lDZ2xkTDUtcjBnUWEyNEJTN29GYVNSeXN